BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ecc-2028-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280620
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280624
SUMMARY:ECC 2028 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:European Control Conference\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-1
 0-30\nOfficial source: https://euca-ecc.org/ecc/\nVenue Radar: https://go
 n-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ecc-2028\nNotes: Meeting dates and host city
  confirmed by the EUCA ECC page (Rimini\, Italy\, 20-23 June 2028). No EC
 C 2028 edition website or call yet\; cfp_url and all deadlines are estima
 ted 1-year projections from the ECC 2027 call\, whose paper deadline was 
 extended from October 31 to November 9\, 2026 (the projection uses the ex
 tended date). ECC 2028 meets about three weeks earlier in the year than E
 CC 2027 (13-16 July)\, so the real deadlines may fall earlier. ECC is the
  annual flagship of the European Control Association\, technically co-spo
 nsored by IFAC and IEEE CSS\, with papers in IEEE Xplore (as for ECC 2027
 ). Not listed in ICORE2026 or CCF. Size L is an editorial category.
CATEGORIES:Control & Robotics,System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics,
 Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos
URL:https://euca-ecc.org/ecc/
LOCATION:Rimini\, Italy
